    ],
    "coreTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "比利在[普通攻击]中进入蹲姿射击后，自身造成的伤害提升50%，进行移动、回到待机、被击退或被击飞时增益效果结束。"
    },
    "additionalAbilityTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "队伍中存在与自身属性或阵营相同的角色时触发：\n比利发动[连携技]后，下次发动[终结技]时，招式造成的伤害提升50%，最多叠加2次，发动[终结技]后效果重置。"
    },
    "cinemaTexts": [
      {
        "en": "When Billy hits an enemy with a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, he gains an additional 2.7 Energy. Can trigger once every 5s.",
        "zh-CN": "[冲刺攻击]或[闪避反击]命中敌人时，比利额外回复2.7点能量，5秒内最多触发一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Billy's Dodge Counter DMG increases by 25%. Rolling Shots during his Basic Attacks count as dodges, making Billy Invulnerable during skill activation and able to trigger Perfect Dodges. When a Rolling Shot triggers a Perfect Dodge, it will automatically follow up with a Dodge Counter.",
        "zh-CN": "[闪避反击]造成的伤害提升25%；[普通攻击]中的翻滚射击将被视为闪避动作，在招式发动期间获得无敌效果，并且能够触发[极限闪避]，翻滚射击触发[极限闪避]时，将自动衔接[闪避反击]。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Billy hits an enemy with his EX Special Attack, the skill's CRIT Rate increases based on the distance from the enemy. The closer he is to the target, the greater the effect, up to a maximum increase of 32%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，招式的暴击率随自身与目标之间的距离而提升；比利与目标距离越近，提升效果越显著，最高提升32%。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Billy accumulates 10 hits on enemies or triggers a Perfect Dodge, his DMG increases by 6%, stacking up to 5 times and lasting until he's knocked back or launched by an attack.",
        "zh-CN": "累计命中敌人10次或触发[极限闪避]时，比利造成的伤害提升6%，最多叠加5层，被敌方击退或击飞后增益效果重置。"
      }
    ]
  }
